e operational records:\n  - `allocation_review.md` — ALLOC-47 — release four queued dispatches after the 18:00 hold\n  - `capacity_window.log` — CAP-31 — three reserve slots remain after route D-17\n  - `exception_register.md` — EXC-88 — pending intake D-15 needs no approval action\n  - `handoff_notes.md` — HAND-62 — cancelled intake D-16 remains excluded from the approved total\n  - `reconciliation_ledger.md` — RECON-53 — approved dispatch amount reconciles to 12 units","ttft_ms":2396,"ttft_stream_ms":2071,"time_to_request_ms":168,"type":"result","duration_ms":41382,"uuid":"01193594-cc23-4eda-8815-c5b8d42e35b0"}
